either-via-split
owner: fable-5.1 session 53f400ad
started: 2026-09-16
what: operator's proposal (2026-09-16): `<|>` defined as
  `split(e)(Left(_))(Right(_))`, so the union's two casts live in ONE
  inline function (split) instead of two; both were inline already,
  the inline lambdas beta-reduce, bytes unchanged. `over` keeps its own
  cast (the reverse direction). Effects.scala only.
